      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=3z^3+pz^2+57z+q\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> are real constants.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3-2\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm i\"></span> is a root of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=0\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>show all the roots of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=0\"></span> on a single Argand diagram, <span class=\"marks\">(7)</span></li><li>find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
