      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-01-2020-october/q4",
      "question": "<p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=2\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j-\\mathbf k+\\lambda(\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j-3\\mathbf k)+\\mu(-\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j+\\mathbf k)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu\"></span> are scalar parameters.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find a Cartesian equation for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol><p>The line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x-1}{5}=\\frac{y-3}{-3}=\\frac{z+2}{4}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Find the coordinates of the point of intersection of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol><p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r.(2\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j+3\\mathbf k)=5\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li>Find, to the nearest degree, the acute angle between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
